      "content": "It sounds like the pressure is becoming unbearable, and that feeling of being one with the cage is incredibly isolating. When everything feels too heavy to hold, sometimes the most immediate relief is simply to let go of the pressure to \"fix\" anything. Just allowing yourself to rest from the struggle, even for a moment, can be a small act of self-preservation.",
